{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>These are the reckonings</b> — plene, with vav, because he reckoned for every 600,000, so they would not suspect him of taking from the silver. \"The Mishkan of the Mishkan\" — read twice on account of Israel's sins, and this is what the Men of the Great Assembly said: חבול חבלנו. The total: twice the numerical value of משכן — a testimony that the Shekhinah dwells among Israel, for the First Temple stood 410 (= ת\"י) years, twice the numerical value of משכן."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 38, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:13.084847954Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}